# This project does not automatically load .env files.
# Optional shell settings for kas-container; source this only after choosing paths.
# String paths: keep shared downloads, sstate, and build output outside the checkout.
# Unset KAS_WORK_DIR uses the kas working directory; local validation sets it explicitly.
# KAS_WORK_DIR=/tmp/meta-qcom-work
# DL_DIR=/tmp/yocto-cache/downloads
# SSTATE_DIR=/tmp/yocto-cache/sstate-cache
# KAS_CONTAINER=/absolute/path/to/kas-container
# KAS_CONTAINER defaults to the executable on PATH in the helper.
# See docs/source/user/CONFIGURATION.md for loading, precedence, and CI-only settings.
